 @8Paul7  "XTX is an awesome card if you do not care about image quality"
What a ridiculous statement. Not every game supports DLSS, and not everyone wants to use upscaling even if they can. With rendering at native resolutions an RX 7900 XTX and RTX 4080 Super produce an identical image.
Your points about ray tracing and power consumption are valid, but asserting that an RX 7900 XTX has worse image quality than an RTX 4080 Super without specifying that it applies to upscaling in games that support DLSS is just nonsense.

